invariant: INV-56
file: mlkem_poly.c
catches: mlkem_test_1024
reason: ByteEncode_11 writes the last coefficient of each group of eight
  without its top bit, so the ciphertext's u is not the one FIPS 203
  packs. Decapsulation re-encrypts and finds another ciphertext, so it
  answers the implicit-reject secret for every honest ciphertext, and the
  round trip in bin/mlkem_test_1024 fails.

--- old
            out[o + 10] = (uint8_t)(t[7] >> 3);
--- new
            out[o + 10] = (uint8_t)((t[7] >> 3) & 0x7f);
